### Install the "REST Client" extension in VS Code, then click "Send Request" above each block.
### 12 sample students are loaded automatically when the app starts.

### ================= READ =================

### Read the first page (5 students, sorted by id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

### Search: name or email contains "ka"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?keyword=ka

### Filter by course and status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?course=Data Science&status=ACTIVE

### Sort by name Z->A, page 2, 3 per page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?sort=name,desc&page=1&size=3

### Read one student
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1

### Course names
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/courses

### Statistics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/stats

### ================= CREATE =================

### Create a student
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Manuthi",
  "email": "manuthi@example.com",
  "age": 21,
  "phone": "0771234567",
  "course": "Software Engineering",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "enrollmentDate": "2025-02-01"
}

### Validation error -> 400 with a message for each wrong field
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "age": 5,
  "phone": "abc",
  "course": "",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Duplicate email -> 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Copy",
  "email": "kasun@example.com",
  "age": 21,
  "course": "Data Science",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### ================= UPDATE =================

### Update all fields of student 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kasun Perera",
  "email": "kasun.p@example.com",
  "age": 22,
  "phone": "0771234567",
  "course": "Data Science",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "enrollmentDate": "2024-02-01"
}

### Change only the status (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "GRADUATED" }

### ================= DELETE =================

### Delete student 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/1

### Read a student that doesn't exist -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/999
